# Even Numbers

A number divisible by 2.

Condition

```python
num % 2 == 0
```

Examples

```text
2
4
6
8
10
```

---

# Odd Numbers

A number not divisible by 2.

Condition

```python
num % 2 != 0
```

Examples

```text
1
3
5
7
9
```

---

# Prime Numbers

A number greater than 1 having exactly two factors.

