# Interview Tips

- Use `% 10` to extract the last digit.
- Use `// 10` to remove the last digit.
- Check for integer overflow when the language has fixed-size integers (e.g., Java, C++).
- Prefer the Euclidean algorithm for GCD instead of checking every factor.
- Distinguish **prime**, **composite**, **even**, and **odd** numbers—they are tested frequently.